3. lines[0] = "# ouyangfeng · 2026-09-04" → matches title_re → strip → text = "## 差异栏\n...".
4. lines[0] = "## 差异栏" → doesn't match title_re. text doesn't start with "---" (starts with "##"). Loop ends.

